      "narrativeId": "n-midterm-democrats-coins",
      "reason": "Democat (\"...lead Democrats to victory\", $1.56M) and DEM (\"Watcher.Guru posted about the U.S. Democratic Party taking both the House and Senate\", $0.26M) tell the US midterm story with the two Mr. Veto coins found by the Codex phrase searches (e3:0; $1.2M): four coins on Pump.fun with metadata or names that name it, $3.04M combined 24h volume, and independent public sources (Reuters, Fox News, CTV News, Newsmax posts, e3:1 and e3:2). GAVELDROP (\"He won the vote. The floor won the gavel... victory speech... Blue ballots fly.\", $2.30M) parodies an election win but names no election, party or Congress, so it is not counted; recorded as deferred. This closes the day 1 Mr. Veto lead."
    },
    "k-giving": {
      "decision": "rejected",
      "reason": "Shared word \"giving\" in unrelated metadata: RAMBO (Silicon Valley / RAM memes), MINTED (a Minted Hub), OAK (a Robinhood Chain coin). e2:1 returned caller shills and a scam alert, no news or official source for a shared story. RAMBO and RAM alone are a possible RAM-price lead (RAMBO description cites Elon Musk and RAM) but only RAMBO has metadata, so it is under the three-coin bar."
    },
